# 热路径放进 IRAM 运行，避免从 Flash 取指令时的缓存未命中：main.cpp 里实例化的 SWD 位带、
# DAP 命令处理和网络收发，以及 XRDAP-Core 每条命令或每拍都走的部分：厂商命令处理、
# MEM-AP 访问和采样器。S3 的 swd_fast.cpp 展开后太大，除一档外留在 Flash（见该文件开头）。
#
# Hot paths run from IRAM to avoid cache misses on flash fetches: the SWD bit-banging,
# DAP command handling and network I/O instantiated in main.cpp, plus the parts of
# XRDAP-Core every command or tick goes through: the vendor command handler, MEM-AP
# access and the sampler. The S3's swd_fast.cpp is too large when unrolled and stays in
# flash except for one level (see the top of that file).
#
# ESP32-S2 是单核，采样与 Wi-Fi、lwIP 共用一个核和指令缓存，热路径留在 Flash 时采样会
# 跳拍。S2 上 main.cpp（主要是 USB 协议栈和 DAP 类，体积大）不放进 IRAM，其余热路径都
# 放进 IRAM / The ESP32-S2 is single-core: sampling shares the core and the instruction
# cache with Wi-Fi and lwIP, and with the hot paths in flash sampling skips ticks. On the
# S2 main.cpp (mostly the USB stack and the DAP class, which is large) stays out of IRAM
# and the other hot paths go into it.
[mapping:xrdap_hot]
archive: libmain.a
entries:
    if IDF_TARGET_ESP32S2 = n:
        main (noflash)
    dap_vendor (noflash)
    protocol (noflash)
    mem_ap (noflash)
    sampler (noflash)
    sampling (noflash)

# libxr 的 FreeRTOS 信号量、互斥量和时基：节拍唤醒采样任务、MemAp::Lock、帧时间戳每拍都走
# 这里 / libxr's FreeRTOS semaphore, mutex and time base: every tick goes through them (the
# sampling task wake-up, MemAp::Lock, the frame timestamp).
[mapping:xrdap_hot_libxr]
archive: libxr.a
entries:
    semaphore (noflash)
    mutex (noflash)
    esp_timebase (noflash)
